[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 21241.67, "timestamp": "05:54:01", "text": "在我们之前约定的地方，还是我们……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21245.11, "timestamp": "05:54:05", "text": "谈谈现在这事儿"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21247.67, "timestamp": "05:54:07", "text": "杂货店那玩意儿，我不知道，我不知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21250.91, "timestamp": "05:54:10", "text": "别说我语无伦次了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21254.628, "timestamp": "05:54:14", "text": "啊，但你很可能明白他们的意思。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21256.628, "timestamp": "05:54:16", "text": "这些游戏将会像它们过去那样进行。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21259.35, "timestamp": "05:54:19", "text": "我猜大概就是原神那玩意儿吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21262.15, "timestamp": "05:54:22", "text": "可以说这个角色非常忙碌"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21265.67, "timestamp": "05:54:25", "text": "作为一项既定任务，我必须找到并完成它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21268.628, "timestamp": "05:54:28", "text": "然后我就得进入那个……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21272.59, "timestamp": "05:54:32", "text": "她，也就是NPC，正在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21277.35, "timestamp": "05:54:37", "text": "用过的。啊，原来那是一辆车，但你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21280.15, "timestamp": "05:54:40", "text": "想知道我是否能喜欢上别人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21283.43, "timestamp": "05:54:43", "text": "选择我想完成的任务"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21290.23, "timestamp": "05:54:50", "text": "嗯，我想那应该不错。但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21293.868, "timestamp": "05:54:53", "text": "不过那会有点麻烦。比如说"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21297.27, "timestamp": "05:54:57", "text": "如果我本该见到的是Sanho，那我岂不是要去见他了？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21299.27, "timestamp": "05:54:59", "text": "去见《Gin Show》的Sanho"}]